 blood pressure and progression to microalbuminuria in type 1 diabetes</article-title>.<source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2002</year>;<volume>347</volume>:<fpage>797</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>805</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12226150</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Voruganti</surname><given-names>VS</given-names></name><name><surname>Nath</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Cole</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Thameem</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Jowett</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Bauer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Maccluer</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Blangero</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Comuzzie</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Abboud</surname><given-names>HE</given-names></name><name><surname>Arar</surname><given-names>NH</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Genetics of variation in serum uric acid and cardiovascular risk factors in Mexican Americans</article-title>.<source>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2009</year>;<volume>94</volume>:<fpage>632</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>638</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19001525</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>16.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Borch-Johnsen</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kreiner</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Proteinuria: value as predictor of cardiovascular mortality in insulin dependent diabetes mellitus</article-title>.<source>Br Med J</source><year>1987</year>;<volume>294</volume>:<fpage>1651</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1654</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3113569</